  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-10-28T21:51:16.415Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the current update of Avatar 3.0, in scripts, <CustomAnimLayer>.animatorController is coming up as always null.\nWas this intentional?\nCode example, if it helps better understand what I mean:\nfxLayer = avatarDescriptor.baseAnimationLayers.Where(layer => layer.type == AnimLayerType.FX).First();\nfxController = fxLayer.animatorController as AnimatorController; //fxController is coming up as always null, should contain the controller, if the user declared one.",
